---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Software Developer | 5+ years building products for ~1M users"
	pubDate={new Date('2026-02-21')}
>
	<section class="section">
		<p class="lead">Software developer with over 5 years of professional experience in web development.</p>
		<p>Currently building products for the WordPress ecosystem at <strong>Themeisle</strong>, helping small business owners and freelancers succeed online. Products I work on are used by almost <strong>1 million users</strong>.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<h2 class="section-title">Skills</h2>
		<div class="skills">
			<span class="skill-tag">PHP</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">Node.js</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">Bun</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">WordPress</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">React</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">TypeScript</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">AWS</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">MySQL</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">Docker</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">Tailwind</span>
			<span class="skill-tag">GitHub Actions</span>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
		<div class="card">
			<div class="job-header">
				<h3>Software Developer</h3>
				<span class="company">@ Themeisle</span>
			</div>
			<div class="meta">
				<span>July 2020 - Present</span>
				<span>·</span>
				<span>5 years 8 months</span>
			</div>
			<p>Building products for the WordPress ecosystem that help small business owners and freelancers.</p>
			
			<h4>Responsibilities</h4>
			<ul>
				<li>Developing and maintaining WordPress plugins and themes used by almost 1 million users</li>
				<li>Building internal tools to increase automation and improve team productivity</li>
				<li>Developing strategic plans aligned with company goals and growth initiatives</li>
				<li>Implementing responsive UI designs and user-friendly interfaces</li>
				<li>Collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver product features</li>
				<li>Mentoring and onboarding new team members</li>
				<li>Participating in technical interviews and recruiting processes</li>
				<li>Writing clean, maintainable, and well-documented code</li>
				<li>Building serverless services and agentic workflows</li>
			</ul>

			<h4>Tech Stack</h4>
			<div class="tech-grid">
				<div class="tech-item">
					<span class="tech-label">Backend</span>
					<span>PHP, Node.js, Bun, WordPress</span>
				</div>
				<div class="tech-item">
					<span class="tech-label">Frontend</span>
					<span>JS/TS, React, jQuery, HTML5, CSS3, SASS, Tailwind</span>
				</div>
				<div class="tech-item">
					<span class="tech-label">Database</span>
					<span>MySQL</span>
				</div>
				<div class="tech-item">
					<span class="tech-label">DevOps</span>
					<span>Docker, Git, GitHub Actions</span>
				</div>
				<div class="tech-item">
					<span class="tech-label">Cloud</span>
					<span>AWS</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
		<div class="card">
			<div class="job-header">
				<h3>Universitatea POLITEHNICA din București</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="meta">
				<span>2021 - 2023</span>
			</div>
			<p>MSc in Graphics, Multimedia & Virtual Reality</p>
			<h4>Key Coursework</h4>
			<div class="coursework">
				<span class="skill-tag">Video Game Programming</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">3D Modeling (Blender)</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">VR/AR Systems</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">GPGPU Programming</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Real-time 3D Graphics Engines</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Image Processing & Analysis</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Game AI Algorithms</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Volumetric Data Visualization</span>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="card">
			<div class="job-header">
				<h3>Facultatea de Științe Aplicate, UPB</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="meta">
				<span>2017 - 2021</span>
			</div>
			<p>Engineer's Degree in Applied Mathematics and Engineering</p>
			<h4>Relevant Coursework</h4>
			<div class="coursework">
				<span class="skill-tag">Data Mining & Big Data</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Machine Learning with Python</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Linear Algebra</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Mathematical Statistics</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Algorithms & Data Structures</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Numerical Methods</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Databases</span>
				<span class="skill-tag">Programming Languages</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<h2 class="section-title">Get In Touch</h2>
		<p>Interested in working together?</p>
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/soare-robert-daniel-949974151/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button">Let's Connect on LinkedIn</a>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.lead {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}
	.job-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	.job-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
	}
	.company {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.meta {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.card h4 {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}
	.card ul {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.tech-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	.tech-item {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.25rem;
	}
	.tech-label {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		color: var(--accent);
	}
	.cta-button {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		background: var(--accent);
		color: var(--bg-dark);
		border-radius: 8px;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}
	.cta-button:hover {
		filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--glow));
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}
</style>
